{"slug":"q-w-m","ar":"ق و م","total":660,"core":"people; standing; establishing; uprightness","forms":[{"ar":"قَوْم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":383,"gloss":"People, nation, folk","word":"qawm","ex":{"s":15,"a":62,"p":3,"ar":["قَالَ","إِنَّكُمْ","قَوْمٌ","مُّنكَرُونَ"],"en":"He said, \"Indeed, you are people unknown"}},{"ar":"قِيَٰمَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":70,"gloss":"Resurrection, Day of Judgment","word":"12","ex":{"s":75,"a":1,"p":4,"ar":["لَآ","أُقْسِمُ","بِيَوْمِ","ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ"],"en":"I swear by the Day of Resurrection"}},{"ar":"أَقَامَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":54,"gloss":"to establish, keep up","word":null,"ex":{"s":8,"a":3,"p":2,"ar":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يُقِيمُونَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَمِمَّا","رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","يُنفِقُونَ"],"en":"The ones who establish prayer, and from what We have provided them, they spend"}},{"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيم","kind":"active participle","form":10,"count":37,"gloss":"straight, upright","word":null,"ex":{"s":1,"a":6,"p":3,"ar":["ٱهْدِنَا","ٱلصِّرَٰطَ","ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمَ"],"en":"Guide us to the straight path"}},{"ar":"قَامَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":33,"gloss":"to stand; to rise","word":null,"ex":{"s":74,"a":2,"p":1,"ar":["قُمْ","فَأَنذِرْ"],"en":"Arise and warn"}},{"ar":"قَآئِم","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":17,"gloss":"standing; upholding","word":null,"ex":{"s":70,"a":33,"p":4,"ar":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُم","بِشَهَـٰدَٰتِهِمْ","قَآئِمُونَ"],"en":"And those who are in their testimonies upright"}},{"ar":"مَقَام","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":14,"gloss":"station, standing place","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":58,"p":2,"ar":["وَكُنُوزٍ","وَمَقَامٍ","كَرِيمٍ"],"en":"And treasures and honorable station"}},{"ar":"مُّقِيم","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":10,"gloss":"lasting; establishing","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":76,"p":3,"ar":["وَإِنَّهَا","لَبِسَبِيلٍ","مُّقِيمٍ"],"en":"And indeed, those cities are [situated] on an established road"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَقَٰمُ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":10,"gloss":"to stand firm; to be upright","word":null,"ex":{"s":81,"a":28,"p":5,"ar":["لِمَن","شَآءَ","مِنكُمْ","أَن","يَسْتَقِيمَ"],"en":"For whoever wills among you to take a right course"}},{"ar":"قَآئِمَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"standing; established","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":71,"p":2,"ar":["وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ","قَآئِمَةٌ","فَضَحِكَتْ","فَبَشَّرْنَـٰهَا","بِإِسْحَـٰقَ","وَمِن","وَرَآءِ","إِسْحَـٰقَ","يَعْقُوبَ"],"en":"And his Wife was standing, and she smiled. Then We gave her good tidings of Isaac and after Isaac, Jacob"}},{"ar":"قَيِّم","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"upright, correct","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":2,"p":1,"ar":["قَيِّمًا","لِّيُنذِرَ","بَأْسًا","شَدِيدًا","مِّن","لَّدُنْهُ","وَيُبَشِّرَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَعْمَلُونَ","ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","أَنَّ","لَهُمْ","أَجْرًا","حَسَنًا"],"en":"[He has made it] straight, to warn of severe punishment from Him and to give good tidings to the believers who do righteous deeds that they will have a good reward"}},{"ar":"أَقْوَم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"more upright, most straight","word":null,"ex":{"s":73,"a":6,"p":7,"ar":["إِنَّ","نَاشِئَةَ","ٱلَّيْلِ","هِىَ","أَشَدُّ","وَطْـًٔا","وَأَقْوَمُ","قِيلًا"],"en":"Indeed, the hours of the night are more effective for concurrence [of heart and tongue] and more suitable for words"}},{"ar":"مُقَام","kind":"passive participle","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"abode, resting place","word":null,"ex":{"s":25,"a":66,"p":4,"ar":["إِنَّهَا","سَآءَتْ","مُسْتَقَرًّا","وَمُقَامًا"],"en":"Indeed, it is evil as a settlement and residence"}},{"ar":"قَوَّٰمِين","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"upholders, maintainers","word":null,"ex":{"s":5,"a":8,"p":5,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","كُونُوا۟","قَوَّٰمِينَ","لِلَّهِ","شُهَدَآءَ","بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۖ","وَلَا","يَجْرِمَنَّكُمْ","شَنَـَٔانُ","قَوْمٍ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَلَّا","تَعْدِلُوا۟ ۚ","ٱعْدِلُوا۟","هُوَ","أَقْرَبُ","لِلتَّقْوَىٰ ۖ","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ ۚ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","خَبِيرٌۢ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"en":"O you who have believed, be persistently standing firm for Allah, witnesses in justice, and do not let the hatred of a people prevent you from being just. Be just; that is nearer to righteousness. And fear Allah; indeed, Allah is Acquainted with what you do"}},{"ar":"قَيُّوم","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"The Self-Subsisting Sustainer","word":"al-qayyum","ex":{"s":3,"a":2,"p":7,"ar":["ٱللَّهُ","لَآ","إِلَـٰهَ","إِلَّا","هُوَ","ٱلْحَىُّ","ٱلْقَيُّومُ"],"en":"Allah - there is no deity except Him, the Ever-Living, the Sustainer of existence"}},{"ar":"إِقَام","kind":"verbal noun","form":4,"count":2,"gloss":"establishment, performing","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":73,"p":9,"ar":["وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","أَئِمَّةً","يَهْدُونَ","بِأَمْرِنَا","وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","إِلَيْهِمْ","فِعْلَ","ٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ","وَإِقَامَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","وَإِيتَآءَ","ٱلزَّكَوٰةِ ۖ","وَكَانُوا۟","لَنَا","عَـٰبِدِينَ"],"en":"And We made them leaders guiding by Our command. And We inspired to them the doing of good deeds, establishment of prayer, and giving of zakah; and they were worshippers of Us"}},{"ar":"قَيِّمَة","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"upright, correct","word":null,"ex":{"s":98,"a":3,"p":3,"ar":["فِيهَا","كُتُبٌ","قَيِّمَةٌ"],"en":"Within which are correct writings"}},{"ar":"إِقَامَت","kind":"verbal noun","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"encampment, stay","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":80,"p":17,"ar":["وَٱللَّهُ","جَعَلَ","لَكُم","مِّنۢ","بُيُوتِكُمْ","سَكَنًا","وَجَعَلَ","لَكُم","مِّن","جُلُودِ","ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","بُيُوتًا","تَسْتَخِفُّونَهَا","يَوْمَ","ظَعْنِكُمْ","وَيَوْمَ","إِقَامَتِكُمْ ۙ","وَمِنْ","أَصْوَافِهَا","وَأَوْبَارِهَا","وَأَشْعَارِهَآ","أَثَـٰثًا","وَمَتَـٰعًا","إِلَىٰ","حِينٍ"],"en":"And Allah has made for you from your homes a place of rest and made for you from the hides of the animals tents which you find light on your day of travel and your day of encampment; and from their wool, fur and hair is furnishing and enjoyment for a time"}},{"ar":"مُقَامَة","kind":"passive participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"permanent abode, permanence","word":null,"ex":{"s":35,"a":35,"p":4,"ar":["ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَحَلَّنَا","دَارَ","ٱلْمُقَامَةِ","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦ","لَا","يَمَسُّنَا","فِيهَا","نَصَبٌ","وَلَا","يَمَسُّنَا","فِيهَا","لُغُوبٌ"],"en":"He who has settled us in the home of duration out of His bounty. There touches us not in it any fatigue, and there touches us not in it weariness [of mind]"}},{"ar":"قَوَام","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"just balance, moderation","word":null,"ex":{"s":25,"a":67,"p":11,"ar":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَآ","أَنفَقُوا۟","لَمْ","يُسْرِفُوا۟","وَلَمْ","يَقْتُرُوا۟","وَكَانَ","بَيْنَ","ذَٰلِكَ","قَوَامًا"],"en":"And [they are] those who, when they spend, do so not excessively or sparingly but are ever, between that, [justly] moderate"}},{"ar":"قِيَم","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"upright, right","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":161,"p":9,"ar":["قُلْ","إِنَّنِى","هَدَىٰنِى","رَبِّىٓ","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطٍ","مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","دِينًا","قِيَمًا","مِّلَّةَ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","حَنِيفًا ۚ","وَمَا","كَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ"],"en":"Say, \"Indeed, my Lord has guided me to a straight path - a correct religion - the way of Abraham, inclining toward truth. And he was not among those who associated others with Allah"}},{"ar":"تَقْوِيم","kind":"verbal noun","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"form, stature","word":null,"ex":{"s":95,"a":4,"p":6,"ar":["لَقَدْ","خَلَقْنَا","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","فِىٓ","أَحْسَنِ","تَقْوِيمٍ"],"en":"We have certainly created man in the best of stature"}}],"surahs":[[7,55],[11,42],[5,34],[2,33],[9,30],[6,27],[4,26],[10,24],[3,20],[16,17],[27,16],[30,15],[28,14],[23,13],[29,13],[43,13],[20,12],[22,12],[39,12],[46,11],[14,10],[18,10],[25,10],[26,10],[40,10],[21,9],[45,9],[17,8],[13,7],[36,7],[12,6],[19,6],[37,6],[42,6],[44,6],[51,6],[8,5],[15,5],[41,5],[35,4],[48,4],[58,4],[61,4],[71,4],[73,4],[24,3],[49,3],[